  "about": {
    "title": "About the Call of Legends set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Call of Legends is a Call of Legends expansion released on 9 February 2011. It has 106 cards: 95 in the main set and 11 Shiny Legends cards. There are also 87 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 95 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (182 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 193 cards, adding the 11 Shiny Legends cards).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
  },
